3. **Segmentation analysis**: Break down KPIs into smaller segments to identify specific areas where adjustments are having an impact.

By using these methods, you can efficiently evaluate the effectiveness of your adjustments and make data-driven decisions to refine your approach without overcorrecting prematurely.

